flowchart LR
 A[Visitor] --> B[Account details and bot check] --> C[Server validates and sends OTP]
 C --> D{Valid OTP?}
 D -->|No| E[Correct code or resend with fresh challenge]
 E --> D
 D -->|Yes| F[Verified account]
 F --> G[Sign in with fresh challenge]
 G --> H[Patient workspace]
 H --> I[Optional authenticated passkey enrollment]
 J[Existing passkey] --> K[Server challenge and WebAuthn verification] --> H